{"recordId":"general_耶律休哥_1811702336","name":"耶律休哥","type":"general","dynasty":"遼夏金","title":"大遼戰神","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"耶律休哥","pageId":273570,"revisionId":94232193,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-07T12:30:06Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%80%B6%E5%BE%8B%E4%BC%91%E5%93%A5","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94232193","wikidataId":"Q14481089","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"耶律休哥葬身阜新北平顶山","url":"http://news.lnd.com.cn/system/2020/04/21/030095016.shtml","type":"citation-template","template":"cite news","author":"張松","publisher":"","date":"2020-04-21","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:39:05.043Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:liaoshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-b274494a66d27961","query":"耶律休哥","count":1,"offset":1821,"excerpt":"。冬十月丁巳朔，駐蹕七渡河。戊辰，以楚國王隆祐為西南面招討使。十一月壬辰，故於越耶律休哥之子道士奴、高九等謀叛，伏誅。丙申，通括南院部民。十二月癸未，罷三京諸道貢。\n\n　　二十二年春正月丁亥，如鴛鴦濼。二月乙卯朔，女直遣使來貢。丙寅，南院樞密使邢抱","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-b3f2e4af38b676c3","query":"耶律休哥","count":1,"offset":891,"excerpt":"人望。尋以母憂去官，詔起視事。表乞終制，不從；宰相密諭上意，乃視事。人以孝稱。及耶律休哥留守南京，又多滯獄，復詔抱樸平決之，人無冤者。改南院樞密使，卒，贈侍中。初，抱樸與弟抱質受經於母陳氏，皆以儒術顯，抱質亦官至侍中，時人榮之。\n\n馬得臣\n\n馬得臣","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-7120cc8abb0e86f0","query":"耶律休哥","count":4,"offset":22,"excerpt":"〔篇題：卷八十三 列傳第十三〕\n〔編者說明：耶律休哥附:馬哥 耶律斜軫 耶律奚低 耶律學古附:烏不呂〕\n\n耶律休哥\n\n耶律休哥，字遜寧。祖釋魯，隋國王。父綰思，南院夷離堇。休哥少有公輔器。初烏古、室韋二部叛，休哥","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-00204635356b82c4","query":"耶律休哥","count":3,"offset":297,"excerpt":"會漢駙馬都尉盧俊來奔，言太原已陷，遂勒兵還。宋乘銳侵燕，沙與戰於高梁河，稍卻；遇耶律休哥及斜軫等邀擊，敗宋軍。宋主宵遁，至涿州，微服乘驢車，間道而走。上以功釋前過。是年，復從韓匡嗣伐宋，敗績，帝欲誅之，以皇后營救得免。睿智皇后稱制，召賜几杖，以優其","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-f9cb0e00e9102049","query":"耶律休哥","count":1,"offset":2178,"excerpt":"朔奴\n\n奚和朔奴，字籌寧，奚可汗之裔。保寧中，為奚六部長。統和初，皇太后稱制，以耶律休哥領南邊事，和朔奴為南面行軍副部署。四年，宋曹彬、米信等來侵，和朔奴與休哥破宋兵於燕南，手詔褒美。軍還，怙權撾無罪人李浩至死，上以其功釋之。六年冬，南征，將本部軍","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-32fd568d9e8d6d97","query":"耶律休哥","count":1,"offset":1399,"excerpt":"都尉，遷南面林牙。從宣徽使耶律阿沒裏征高麗還，改北面林牙。會宋將曹彬、米信侵燕，耶律休哥與恒德議軍事，多見信用，為東京留守。六年，上攻宋，圍沙堆，恒德獨當一面。城上矢石如雨，恒德意氣自若，督將士奪其陴。城陷，中流矢，太后親臨視，賜藥。攻長城口，復先","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":6,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:liaoshi-b274494a66d27961","bookId":"book:liaoshi","requestedTitle":"遼史/卷14","title":"遼史/卷14","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%81%BC%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B714","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1745954","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%81%BC%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B714?action=history","revisionId":1745954,"revisionTimestamp":"2019-10-12T08:34:58Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:56:02.271Z","sha256":"b09852bb6cfeb9db6ae90432e5e929250c9ed810c17d5499043e4cbc6433bdd1","textSha256":"777c72702aa756631ed9f4c338f0ac320693ac85c5e13846fffb6d9298876c78","expandedWikitextSha256":"b09852bb6cfeb9db6ae90432e5e929250c9ed810c17d5499043e4cbc6433bdd1","characters":3730,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/liaoshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:40.873Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percen